WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.360
How to talk about fake photos and videos.

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:05.800
Help your child spot fakes with three questions.

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:06.800
Who made it?

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:08.500
What's the proof?

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:10.710
Who else says so?

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:12.420
How to use it?

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:15.660
Look at one viral post together and ask the three questions.

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:18.210
Tap go there to open it.
